Package: nycpluto
Title: NYC Primary Land Use Tax Lot Output (PLUTO)
Version: 0.0.1.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Kieran", "Healy", , "kjhealy@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9114-981X"))
Description: The New York City Department of City Planning Primary Land
    Use Tax Lot Output (PLUTO) and MapPLUTO: one record per tax lot with
    land use, building, zoning, ownership, and assessed value fields, plus
    lot polygons. Data are stored as a GeoParquet file and accessed via
    duckplyr. Also includes the PLUTO change file and land use and
    building class lookup tables.
